<li>Microsoft Learn: <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/troubleshoot/developer/webapps/aspnet/www-authentication-authorization/authorization-permissions">Control authorization permissions in an ASP.NET application</a>.</li>
<li>Common Weakness Enumeration: <a href="https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/285.html">CWE-285</a>.</li>
